Use `Text.Trim` and `Text.Proper`.

```powerquery
= Table.TransformColumns(
    #"Previous Step",
    {
        {
            "Name",
            each Text.Proper(Text.Trim(_)),
            type text
        }
    }
)
```

`Text.Trim` removes leading/trailing spaces, and `Text.Proper` capitalizes the first letter of each word.
